    21	| Fixed model/egg/projectile resources | Implemented | Thirty-six exact constructor-only resource methods; dynamic resources remain untouched. |
    22	| AI movement-request cadence | Implemented | Three exact flight/follow goals; `@Unique` counters reset by the common `WrappedGoal` start/stop transition hook. Target `canUse()`/`start()`/`stop()` methods remain untouched. Vanilla `canContinueToUse()` delegates to `canUse()`, so `canUse()` is not a reset point. The first eligible request after start runs immediately, then every configured interval. Only navigation/circle calls are gated. |
    23	| Egg hatch-check cadence | Implemented | The exact upstream 20-tick constant is redirected to the COMMON config interval; hatch state updates, side effects, and order remain in the original method. |
    24	| Shock particle cadence | Implemented | The exact particle 8-tick constant is configurable; the separate 20-tick damage constant is untouched. |
    25	| Packet particle-handler local caching | Deferred | Client-only caching remains outside this release because it is not required for the documented companion boundary. |
