      "category": "CPU/MSPT and behavior",
      "title": "The AI interval is counted per redirected invocation, not per goal tick",
      "locations": [
        "src/main/java/network/vonix/isleofberkperformance/mixin/DragonFlyAndAttackAirbourneTargetGoalMixin.java:40",
        "src/main/java/network/vonix/isleofberkperformance/mixin/DragonFollowPlayerFlyingMixin.java:39",
