CHANGELOG.md:9:- Same Mixin surface as `0.3.1-rc.3`: no stock dragon geo/anim pin, so Variant Loader / HybridsPlus / variant packs can remap those resources.
CHANGELOG.md:17:- Stop cancelling dragon `getModelLocation` / `getAnimationFileLocation` (and do not pin dragon textures). Variant Loader 2.6.4/2.7.0 overwrites those lookups via `BaseDragonModelMixin`, per-species model mixins, and `ModelRedirectUtil`; a HEAD-cancellable stock `ResourceLocation` prevented variant geo/anim from applying and exploded remapped dragons.
CHANGELOG.md:18:- Stop cancelling egg `getModelLocation`. Variant Loader remaps egg geo/texture through `DragonEggModelHelper`; egg animation remains constructor-constant and is still reused.
CHANGELOG.md:19:- Keep the twelve renderer `getRenderType` argument-reuse mixins and the FireBolt/FuryBolt constructor-constant projectile mixins. Variant Loader does not remap those projectile methods.
CHANGELOG.md:22:Release-candidate artifact is rebuilt from the publication commit; record the final SHA-256 after that rebuild. GitHub prerelease only. Latest remains 0.3.0. No runtime client retest of exploded variants is claimed. No MSPT/FPS claim. Publication does not authorize live-server deploy.
CHANGELOG.md:27:- Compile pin remains Forge 40.3.0. This is a metadata compatibility fix, not a mixin/runtime rewrite.
CHANGELOG.md:42:- Use the production-remapped `WrappedGoal.getGoal()` accessor (`m_26015_()` in the SRG runtime).
CHANGELOG.md:43:- Add deterministic mapping and lifecycle fixtures covering the prior production and runtime failure modes.
CHANGELOG.md:64:- The optional `isleofberk-deadlockfix` mod remains separate and is not bundled or replaced.
CHANGELOG.md:66:- Network protocol, deadlock/chunk access, spawning, world generation, pathfinder algorithms, and dynamic resource selection remain outside this release.
CHANGELOG.md:74:- Fresh Forge server runtime: all five common gameplay mixins applied and server reached `Done (12.028s)`.
README.md:10:> **This is a companion, not a fork or replacement.** Keep the original `isleofberk-1.2.0.jar` installed. This project does not redistribute Isle of Berk classes or resources and does not include the separate `isleofberk-deadlockfix` mod.
README.md:30:Successor to `0.3.1-rc.2`. Stops pinning stock dragon geo/anim (and egg geo) so Variant Loader / variant packs can remap those resources. Compile pin remains Forge 40.3.0. Promoted into 1.0.0.
README.md:77:The optional `isleofberk-deadlockfix` mod remains a separate artifact. Do not merge the JARs or treat this companion as a replacement for it.
README.md:85:- Eight constructor-constant egg-animation and projectile resource transformations. Dragon geo/anim/texture and egg geo/texture remain uncancelled so Variant Loader can remap them.
README.md:109:- deadlock/safety/chunk-access behavior, including `getChunkNow` and `scratchPosDeadlockFix`;
README.md:110:- Variant Loader compatibility, taming, spawning, or world generation;
README.md:123:- `auditPackagedJar`: companion-only archive; no bundled Isle of Berk or deadlock-fix content
README.md:126:- Fresh Forge server runtime: all five common gameplay mixins applied; server reached `Done (12.028s)`
